 "about": "Batch 25 (11 Nov 2026), registered before its scores: discovery, first two tables, on the trial-fixed engine (greyhound/metrics.py: the time standards and the meeting variant from graded races only, commit c2e76fa; the feature cache rebuilds). fix1 is batch 23's all1_xtime recipe (the live trees with the expected-time table, one seed) on the new cache: read against batch 23's 0.3465 for the effect of the fix (unpaired, same seed and recipe). fix1_dyad adds the dyadic memory table (greyhound/pit/dyad.py: what each pair of dogs has done to each other beyond their expected times, and the curl of the margin flow). fix1_cycle adds the season-cycle table (greyhound/pit/cycle.py: a bitch's seasons inferred from her absences, her own cycle, her phase and days to the next). fix1_both adds both. The bar: 3 bootstrap standard errors on the RMSE of log(BSP) against fix1, the log-loss no worse beyond 1; the market reading beside it: the weight on our price in the blend with the BSP and the blend's log-loss.",
